<title>MONGOLIA: Eleven drown as Mongolian river boat capsizes.</title>
<headline>Eleven drown as Mongolian river boat capsizes.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eleven people drowned when a ferry capsized on a northern Mongolian river, civil defence officials said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The dead were among 16 passengers aboard the ferry, which capsized when crossing the Orkhon River in Selenge province last Thursday, the officials told Reuters.</p>
<p>The accident was caused by an uneven load, they added.</p>
